{"id": "EUVD-2026-101250", "enisaUuid": "9626d38d-cb5d-3ddc-94e0-de4b0561766b", "description": "Papermerge Core through 3.5.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated users to manipulate other users' pages because page management and OCR endpoints skip has_node_perm checks. Attackers knowing page UUIDs can call /pages/, /pages/move, or /pages/extract to rotate, delete, or extract victims' pages, and trigger OCR via /tasks/ocr.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:16:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T18:08:00", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/issues/1290", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/blob/3.5.3/papermerge/core/features/document/router_pages.py#L29-L131", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/blob/3.5.3/papermerge/core/features/tasks/router.py#L17-L35", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/commit/6ad2836dc40b61bd032146013272036bbece6144", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/papermerge-core-through-3.5.3-missing-authorization-in-page-management-and-ocr-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110622", "GHSA-58xx-g452-q822"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.5, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "63c7e279-6ceb-31e7-b554-07d7e14d2962", "product": {"name": "papermerge-core", "vendor": {"name": "Papermerge"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.5.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8cd61fb9-b2f0-386d-af2e-324670f6747b", "vendor": {"name": "Papermerge"}}], "isExploited": false}